@startuml UcForgotPassword

title Authentication — ForgotPasswordUseCase

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

' ── Ports OUT ─────────────────────────────────
interface "LoadUserPort"       as LOAD #A5D6A7
interface "DomainEventPublisher" as PUB #A5D6A7

' ══ ForgotPasswordUseCase ════════════════════
package "ForgotPasswordUseCase" #FCE4EC {
    interface "ForgotPasswordPort" as P_FRG
    component [ForgotPasswordUseCase] as UC_FRG
    P_FRG ..|> UC_FRG
}

UC_FRG --> LOAD : findByEmail(email)
UC_FRG --> PUB  : PasswordResetRequestedEvent

note right of PUB
  PasswordResetRequestedEvent incluye
  email + resetToken.
  El listener envía el correo de
  recuperación al usuario.
end note

note right of UC_FRG
  Si el email no existe:
  responde silenciosamente (sin error)
  para evitar user enumeration.
end note

@enduml

